| Security | License Check | license-checker | pom.xml、package.json |
| Security | Container Scan | trivy image | Dockerfile |
| Security | IaC Scan | checkov | deployment.yaml、service.yaml |
| Infrastructure | Docker Build | docker build | Dockerfile |
